    rdfs:label "Outcome"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A result, goal, benefit, or theme to which an EKG use case or story contributes, classified by an outcome stereotype and optionally prioritized."@en .

<https://ekgf.org/ontology/outcome#OutcomeStereoTypeBenefit>
